graphs. Therefore, we have pre-processed these data to allow us to summarise
the results and present them in the paper. Thus, the data presented in this paper
are preprocessed for discussion and analysis. However, the clustering was performed using the complete data. Furthermore, for the sake of transparency, replicability, and confidence in our study, we have published the raw data in a
public repository that can be consulted here: https://zenodo.org/records
/10262145. D. Mosquera et al.

